{"scenario": "view/minimap-folds-per-language", "requires": ["v1", "test-hooks"], "doc": "The hub's fold ranges (minimap and folding design \u00a77.4, the source for a buffer with no parser of its own) for each of the eleven built-in tree-sitter languages: each pack's queries/folds.scm against its pinned grammar, on a fixture in test/conformance/fixtures/folds, pinned as a golden list of [first line, last line, kind] (lines from 1). A node within one line is no range; of the ranges starting on one line the largest stays, on a tie the more specific kind."}
{"do": "root"}
{"do": "run", "bin": "/bin/sh", "args": ["-c", "mkdir -p $ROOT/repo && cd $ROOT/repo && git init -q -b main && cp $SCENARIOS/fixtures/folds/* . && git add . && git -c user.email=t@example.invalid -c user.name=t commit -qm base"], "expect_code": 0}
{"do": "start", "hub": "h", "args": ["--test-clock"]}
{"do": "connect", "conn": "e", "hub": "h"}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 1, "method": "subscribe"}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 1, "result": true}}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 2, "method": "minimap/watch", "params": {"file": "$ROOT/repo/a.rs", "on": true}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"event": "view-model", "data": {"minimap": {"file": "$ROOT/repo/a.rs", "layer": "folds", "version": "$number", "items": [[1, 4, "import"], [6, 7, "comment"], [8, 11, "class"], [13, 21, "class"], [14, 20, "function"], [15, 18, "block"], [24, 29, "test"], [26, 28, "test"]]}}}, "within_ms": 30000}
